OL,3,GNEWSAAirlines criticise air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol as second glitch causes more
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirlines have criticised the UK's air
OL,8,Ftraffic control system after a second
OL,9,Ftechnical problem in two weeks caused
OL,10,Fmajor disruption to UK flights.
OL,12,FEasyJet said Monday's incident "once
OL,13,Fagain calls into question the
OL,14,Fresilience" of the service, while Wizz
OL,15,FAir said there was a "national
OL,16,Fconfidence crisis" in National Air
OL,17,FTraffic Services (Nats), which runs the
OL,18,FUK's air traffic.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
