OL,3,GNEWSAAirlines criticise air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol as second glitch causes more
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats said a "connectivity issue" at
OL,8,FPrestwick was behind the disruption
OL,9,Facross Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,10,Fnorthern England - and had "nothing to
OL,11,Fdo" with a separate software defect at
OL,12,FSwanwick earlier this month.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said
OL,15,Ffurther issues today "cause even
OL,16,Fgreater concern" about the UK's air
OL,17,Ftraffic control.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
